  description: "Once per turn, you can activate 1 of these Skills based on the face-up
    monster(s) you control:\r\n\u25CF \"Elemental HERO\": Discard 1 Trap, then add
    1 Level 6 or lower Machine \"roid\" monster from your GY to your hand, then you
    can destroy 1 monster your opponent controls whose ATK is less than or equal
    to the added card's.\r\n\u25CF Machine \"roid\": Discard 1 Spell, then Special
    Summon 1 Level 6 or lower Machine \"roid\" or \"Elemental HERO\" monster from
    your Deck in Defense Position, but negate its effects.\r\n \u25CF Both: Discard
    1 card, then Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster using only \"roid\" and \"Elemental
    HERO\" monsters you control.\r\nEach of these Skills can only be used once per
    Duel."
